  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bridging Insights: Towards a Research-Based Conflict Resolution Model</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The aim of the project is to take the first critical steps in building the ecosystem needed to positively transform the Israel-Palestinian conflict; by engaging and mobilizing a significant network of diverse leaders, and by incorporating knowledge from a research-driven model on conflict resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
